[
  {
    "comment": "读取高清鸭固定 DSU 签到页，使用 Cookie 与同一浏览器 User-Agent 确认登录态、动态 formhash 和当前账号今日状态；已签到时不重复提交",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://hdduck.com/plugin.php?id=dsu_paulsign:sign",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Cookie",
          "value": "{{cookie}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "User-Agent",
          "value": "{{user_agent}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept-Language",
          "value": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9"
        },
        {
          "name": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "no-cache"
        }
      ],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "/(?=[\\s\\S]*action=logout)(?=[\\s\\S]*name=[\"']formhash[\"'][^>]*value=[\"'][^\"']+)/i",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "您需要先登录|请先登录|member\\.php\\?mod=logging(?:&amp;|&)action=login|id=[\"']lsform[\"']|name=[\"']username[\"']|请输入验证码|请完成[^\\n]{0,20}验证|滑动[^\\n]{0,20}验证|极验|Geetest|<title>[^<]*(?:Just a moment|Attention Required)[^<]*</title>|id=[\"']challenge-form[\"']|cf-chl-|__cf_chl_|access_(?:env|slide)_challenge",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "extract_variables": [
        {
          "name": "formhash",
          "re": "name=[\"']formhash[\"'][^>]*value=[\"']([^\"']+)",
          "from": "content"
        },
        {
          "name": "account_uid",
          "re": "discuz_uid\\s*=\\s*[\"']([1-9]\\d*)[\"']",
          "from": "content"
        },
        {
          "name": "signed_today",
          "re": "/(?=[\\s\\S]*您今天已经签到过了)(?=[\\s\\S]*上次签到时间[：:]\\s*<font[^>]*>{{1|date_time(0)}}\\s+\\d{2}:\\d{2})(您今天已经签到过了)/",
          "from": "content"
        },
        {
          "name": "needs_submit",
          "re": "id=[\"'](qiandao)[\"']",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "仅在当前账号今日尚未签到时提交一次固定 DSU 表单",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "{% if needs_submit %}",
      "headers": [],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [],
      "failed_asserts": [],
      "extract_variables": []
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "提交高清鸭固定签到表单；HTTP 回执只用于拒绝明确错误，最终结果由刷新复核",
    "request": {
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "https://hdduck.com/plugin.php?id=dsu_paulsign:sign&operation=qiandao&infloat=1",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Cookie",
          "value": "{{cookie}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "User-Agent",
          "value": "{{user_agent}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept-Language",
          "value": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9"
        },
        {
          "name": "Content-Type",
          "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
        },
        {
          "name": "Referer",
          "value": "https://hdduck.com/plugin.php?id=dsu_paulsign:sign"
        },
        {
          "name": "Origin",
          "value": "https://hdduck.com"
        }
      ],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "formhash={{formhash|urlencode}}&qdxq=kx&qdmode=3&todaysay=&fastreply=0",
      "mimeType": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "签到成功|已经签到|今日已签到|已经签过",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "您需要先登录|请先登录|id=[\"']lsform[\"']|name=[\"']username[\"']|非法字符|未定义操作|不在允许签到时间|签到时间还未开始|请输入验证码|请完成[^\\n]{0,20}验证|滑动[^\\n]{0,20}验证|极验|Geetest|<title>[^<]*(?:Just a moment|Attention Required)[^<]*</title>|id=[\"']challenge-form[\"']|cf-chl-|__cf_chl_",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "extract_variables": []
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "签到提交条件结束",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "{% endif %}",
      "headers": [],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [],
      "failed_asserts": [],
      "extract_variables": []
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "刷新固定签到页，确认同一账号且上次签到时间就是今天",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://hdduck.com/plugin.php?id=dsu_paulsign:sign",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Cookie",
          "value": "{{cookie}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "User-Agent",
          "value": "{{user_agent}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept-Language",
          "value": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9"
        },
        {
          "name": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "no-cache"
        }
      ],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "/(?=[\\s\\S]*action=logout)(?=[\\s\\S]*discuz_uid\\s*=\\s*[\"']{{account_uid}}[\"'])(?=[\\s\\S]*您今天已经签到过了)(?=[\\s\\S]*上次签到时间[：:]\\s*<font[^>]*>{{1|date_time(0)}}\\s+\\d{2}:\\d{2})/",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "您需要先登录|请先登录|member\\.php\\?mod=logging(?:&amp;|&)action=login|id=[\"']lsform[\"']|name=[\"']username[\"']|请输入验证码|请完成[^\\n]{0,20}验证|滑动[^\\n]{0,20}验证|极验|Geetest|<title>[^<]*(?:Just a moment|Attention Required)[^<]*</title>|id=[\"']challenge-form[\"']|cf-chl-|__cf_chl_|access_(?:env|slide)_challenge",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "extract_variables": [
        {
          "name": "__log__",
          "re": "(您今天已经签到过了)",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
]
